    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280977,281014</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手伝いますか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Help them out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277596</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>簡単に手伝うって
言っても……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's really easy to
say you'll help, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>戦士のコスチューム着て、
でかい武器で
ガンガン掘り抜くって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll just put on one of those warrior
costumes and use my huge
weapon to smash right through!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277744</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>気をつけてね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, but be careful...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277796</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わかってるって！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I got you!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277908</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>トレジャーハンターの
コスチューム着りゃ、石のある
場所なんて一発で的中だぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I'm wearing that Treasure
Hunter costume, I'll find the
right stones straight away!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277956</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>本当かなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you sure about that...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まかせとけって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just leave it to me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278060</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ま、なんとかなるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, I'll manage somehow.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんとかって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Somehow"...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>よし、じゃ、
ついてきてくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright, then,
come with me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278284</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうか……なかなか
集まらなくて、ネコの手も
借りたかったんだけどな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I see... Well, we've been digging
up so little, we'll hire pretty
much anyone right now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278348</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひでぇ！
オレ、ネコの手！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn! So, what,
I'm your last resort!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278440</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すまんすまん。
気が変わったら、
いつでも声かけてくれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry, sorry. Anyway,
if you do change your
mind, just let me know.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276776</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　なんだ？
募集でも見たか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh? What's up?
You see the flyer?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼ、しゅう……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Flyer...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、『紅の月』掘る
アルバイトだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, for the job digging
up Crimson Moon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276976</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>『紅の月』って
人工マナの材料だね……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Crimson Moon"... That was a material
for making artificial mana, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ってか、おまえみたいな
子どもでは無理か、ははははっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I guess a couple of kids like
you wouldn't be any help! Hahahaha!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>へへんだ、オレだって
そんなの軽いぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Heh heh, nah, should be
a piece of cake for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277204</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっと、
&lt;Dio&gt;ったラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wait, &lt;Dio&gt;,
please don't...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277272</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……なりきり士の力が
あるだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I've got the power of
a Roleplayer, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277320</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうだけド……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's true, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>言っとくけど、
岩盤掘り抜くには
それ相応の力も必要だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just to let you know, you'll
need a lot of power to
smash through the bedrock.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それにどこに『紅の月』が
あるか、それを掘り当てる
勘ってヤツも必要だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And you'll need to be able to
figure out where the Crimson
Moon's actually buried, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、手伝ってくれるか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up? You want to help out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280740</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まだ採掘場の人手を
募集してるぜ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're still recruiting
for the mining gig.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280848</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、行くか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well then, let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280916</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>また機会があれば、
よろしくな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well if you ever get the
chance, I'll be waiting.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
